					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXPAND\nThe Expand node takes its input and fills its channels with it. \nThe way the input is wrapped over the channels can be set to different modes in the inspector.\n\nExpand is commonly used(as an alternative to Linear or Sequence) to set the instance count of a collection. But the node can also be used creatively to generated patterns or color schemes."
					}
				},
